
Q1. Display the first_name and age of all customers.

SELECT first_name, age
FROM Customers;


Q2. Display all customers whose age is greater than 25.

  
SELECT first_name, age
FROM Customers
WHERE age>25;

Q3. Display the item and amount from Orders where the amount is greater than 500.

  
SELECT item, amount
FROM Orders
WHERE amount>500;

Q4. Display all customers who are from the USA.
  
SELECT first_name, last_name,country
FROM Customers
WHERE country='USA';
